WEBVTT

00:00:06.690 --> 00:00:09.150
Y-You didn't need to kill her!

00:00:09.580 --> 00:00:11.420
I didn't have a choice!

00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:14.640
She ran off with the money!

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:18.460
But if she's dead, we won't 
know where the money is!

00:00:19.060 --> 00:00:21.180
Anyway, we need to get out of here.

00:00:21.180 --> 00:00:22.860
W-What about my money?

00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:25.000
There's no time for that!

00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:26.960
I'm running!

00:00:27.730 --> 00:00:29.020
Hey, wait!

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:43.040
<i>The most difficult part of 
a con isn't the con itself,</i>

00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:44.290
<i>but the escape.</i>

00:00:44.900 --> 00:00:48.760
<i>The bigger the amount of money, 
the harder they'll look.</i>

00:00:49.090 --> 00:00:50.210
<i>And when it's a big haul,</i>

00:00:50.210 --> 00:00:51.970
<i>the best thing to do is play dead.</i>

00:00:52.520 --> 00:00:54.780
<i>If they think they're 
an accomplice to murder,</i>

00:00:54.780 --> 00:00:56.540
<i>they'll stop following you.</i>

00:00:56.990 --> 00:00:59.250
<i>And they'll give up on the money.</i>

00:01:02.920 --> 00:01:07.030
<i>Of course, only a professional 
could ever do something so bold.</i>

00:01:07.380 --> 00:01:09.500
<i>A pro like me.</i>

00:02:45.930 --> 00:02:50.940
Ramberg Embassy

00:02:49.570 --> 00:02:51.940
Listen, ambassador.

00:02:51.940 --> 00:02:55.280
If you can't pay your debts,

00:02:55.280 --> 00:02:58.240
you'll have to repay us some other way.

00:02:58.590 --> 00:03:02.200
S-Some other way?

00:03:07.090 --> 00:03:10.080
We're modern businessmen.

00:03:10.530 --> 00:03:12.910
We would never suggest having

00:03:12.910 --> 00:03:14.960
your daughter pay with her body.

00:03:15.630 --> 00:03:17.540
I'll get to the point,

00:03:17.540 --> 00:03:20.170
we'd like to make a casino here.

00:03:20.540 --> 00:03:21.590
A casino?

00:03:22.170 --> 00:03:24.720
The laws don't apply on embassy grounds.

00:03:25.190 --> 00:03:28.700
If we got a few of our best 
customers here for some fun games,

00:03:28.700 --> 00:03:31.500
it wouldn't be easy for the 
police to find them at all.

00:03:31.500 --> 00:03:33.590
A casino in the embassy?

00:03:33.590 --> 00:03:35.560
That's impossible!

00:03:35.830 --> 00:03:36.920
It's nothing.

00:03:36.920 --> 00:03:39.240
We'll just put some 
tables in the basement,

00:03:39.240 --> 00:03:42.220
and serve some drinks.

00:03:42.220 --> 00:03:44.560
We'll bring our own staff.

00:03:44.560 --> 00:03:47.280
You don't need to do a thing.

00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:48.990
B-But...

00:03:48.990 --> 00:03:50.330
Don't you get it?

00:03:51.380 --> 00:03:54.020
You're not in a position to say no.

00:03:55.600 --> 00:03:58.500
Father! Father!

00:03:59.130 --> 00:04:00.130
Sarah!

00:04:02.470 --> 00:04:03.900
Stop it!

00:04:03.900 --> 00:04:04.910
Fine.

00:04:04.910 --> 00:04:08.010
I'll do it. So leave my daughter alone.

00:04:10.290 --> 00:04:11.390
Father...

00:04:11.690 --> 00:04:15.650
I love seeing the moment 
when a man loses.

00:04:16.120 --> 00:04:19.650
At a casino, I can see people 
lose whenever I want.

00:04:20.060 --> 00:04:22.220
Isn't it wonderful?

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:28.660
One month later

00:04:48.680 --> 00:04:49.680
Arita.

00:04:49.680 --> 00:04:51.780
We're making some good 
money today, aren't we?

00:04:53.220 --> 00:04:56.280
Never a dull moment around here.

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:04.530
<b>Hanabuki-chou First Avenue</b>

00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:28.800
<b>Cabaret Club 99</b>

00:05:25.010 --> 00:05:28.800
Um, do you know any gamblers 
who are really good?

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:39.850
Is this...

00:05:51.190 --> 00:05:52.350
Um...

00:05:51.190 --> 00:05:55.450
Hanabuki-chou Seventh Avenue
 8-9-7,
 SC Mansion, 201

00:06:03.050 --> 00:06:06.900
Okay, maybe it's time to get serious.

00:06:07.490 --> 00:06:08.390
Raise.

00:06:09.270 --> 00:06:10.260
I'm out.

00:06:10.260 --> 00:06:11.430
Me, too.

00:06:12.420 --> 00:06:13.570
I'm in.

00:06:14.450 --> 00:06:15.400
Open.

00:06:16.610 --> 00:06:18.060
Straight flush.

00:06:19.180 --> 00:06:20.440
I lose.

00:06:21.940 --> 00:06:23.950
Another win for me.

00:06:24.530 --> 00:06:26.120
Want to take a break?

00:06:26.120 --> 00:06:28.000
Yeah, I could use a breather.

00:06:28.820 --> 00:06:32.880
Um... are you a really good gambler?

00:06:35.210 --> 00:06:36.390
Yeah...

00:06:36.390 --> 00:06:37.860
Can't you tell?

00:06:37.860 --> 00:06:39.150
I have a request.

00:06:40.270 --> 00:06:42.260
My nation's embassy was turned

00:06:42.260 --> 00:06:45.280
into a casino because we 
couldn't pay our debts.

00:06:45.280 --> 00:06:48.380
I want you to win big 
there and ruin them!

00:06:51.240 --> 00:06:53.550
Sure, I'll do it.

00:06:54.080 --> 00:06:55.310
Really?

00:06:55.540 --> 00:06:56.810
Yeah.

00:06:56.810 --> 00:06:58.520
But if I'm going to take

00:06:58.520 --> 00:07:00.360
down an entire underground casino,

00:07:00.360 --> 00:07:02.540
I'll need funds.

00:07:02.540 --> 00:07:04.310
How much?

00:07:04.310 --> 00:07:05.270
One million yen?

00:07:05.270 --> 00:07:07.320
No, maybe two million?

00:07:07.680 --> 00:07:10.460
I think I can get two million.

00:07:10.460 --> 00:07:11.180
Really?

00:07:11.180 --> 00:07:12.320
Yes!

00:07:12.540 --> 00:07:13.450
Okay.

00:07:13.450 --> 00:07:14.780
Leave it to me.

00:07:19.550 --> 00:07:20.960
What's so funny?

00:07:20.960 --> 00:07:23.420
I was just thinking it must be a

00:07:23.420 --> 00:07:25.210
pretty pathetic casino

00:07:25.210 --> 00:07:27.330
if two million's enough to take it down.

00:07:28.320 --> 00:07:30.190
I can do it.

00:07:30.690 --> 00:07:33.760
If I keep winning and doubling it up,

00:07:33.760 --> 00:07:37.220
I can turn it into one 
or two hundred million.

00:07:38.680 --> 00:07:40.140
Amazing.

00:07:40.140 --> 00:07:42.780
Then want to have a real game with me?

00:07:42.780 --> 00:07:44.260
For two million?

00:07:46.240 --> 00:07:49.490
Sure, I'm in.

00:08:14.290 --> 00:08:16.680
Are you both ready?

00:08:21.720 --> 00:08:22.690
Open.

00:08:26.300 --> 00:08:27.690
Four of a kind.

00:08:34.210 --> 00:08:35.910
Straight flush.

00:08:39.390 --> 00:08:40.740
Sorry!

00:08:41.970 --> 00:08:43.000
Wait.

00:08:45.010 --> 00:08:46.750
W-What?

00:08:46.970 --> 00:08:48.370
You cheated.

00:08:48.770 --> 00:08:50.990
You had a full house.

00:08:52.680 --> 00:08:54.840
Are you calling me a cheater?

00:09:11.370 --> 00:09:13.490
Okay, that's enough.

00:09:13.800 --> 00:09:15.790
Everybody stay where you are.

00:09:17.610 --> 00:09:18.570
Come with me.

00:09:26.050 --> 00:09:26.860
Hey!

00:09:33.360 --> 00:09:34.720
Come on, hurry!

00:09:37.460 --> 00:09:38.340
Jump!

00:09:58.540 --> 00:10:01.560
<i>Letting a girl you don't 
know into your home...</i>

00:10:01.560 --> 00:10:04.200
<i>It's not something a 
pro like me should do.</i>

00:10:04.660 --> 00:10:07.090
<i>I don't know why I did it.</i>

00:10:07.640 --> 00:10:10.630
<i>Maybe it's because I'm 
from another world</i>

00:10:10.630 --> 00:10:12.500
<i>and she's from another country.</i>

00:10:12.880 --> 00:10:15.630
<i>Perhaps I felt we're kindred spirits.</i>

00:10:16.440 --> 00:10:17.880
Here you are.

00:10:20.860 --> 00:10:22.000
It's great!

00:10:22.000 --> 00:10:23.140
I'm glad.

00:10:23.540 --> 00:10:25.710
It's food from my country.

00:10:25.710 --> 00:10:27.660
My grandmother taught me.

00:10:29.610 --> 00:10:33.630
Um, about the casino, would you do it?

00:10:33.630 --> 00:10:36.040
I know you're a great gambler...

00:10:36.040 --> 00:10:37.190
Stop right there.

00:10:37.740 --> 00:10:39.930
First, I'm not a gambler.

00:10:39.930 --> 00:10:41.030
I'm a con artist.

00:10:42.030 --> 00:10:43.280
A con artist?

00:10:43.620 --> 00:10:46.500
Of course, there are all 
kinds of con artists.

00:10:46.500 --> 00:10:50.030
Like that small-time cheater back there.

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:56.690
I'd never do anything so meager as

00:10:56.690 --> 00:10:58.260
stealing money from a rich girl.

00:10:58.790 --> 00:11:00.300
I only go for the big jobs.

00:11:01.060 --> 00:11:04.430
And I'll stoop to any level.

00:11:04.430 --> 00:11:06.350
And I'll do it well.

00:11:07.360 --> 00:11:11.390
That's why they started calling 
me the Brutal Maiden.

00:11:11.390 --> 00:11:15.750
If you're going to hire me, 
you'd better be prepared.

00:11:18.090 --> 00:11:20.570
Then you'll do it, won't you?

00:11:20.870 --> 00:11:22.810
Well, you're going to help.

00:11:23.360 --> 00:11:26.580
First, you'll have to learn to use this.

00:11:37.130 --> 00:11:39.260
I'll also need a map of the embassy,

00:11:39.260 --> 00:11:41.130
access to its security systems,

00:11:41.130 --> 00:11:42.520
and the location of its guards.

00:11:42.930 --> 00:11:45.440
Can you get that for me?

00:11:45.440 --> 00:11:46.600
I'll do it.

00:11:47.660 --> 00:11:51.420
I'll destroy that casino for you.

00:12:07.460 --> 00:12:10.630
<i>Taking down a casino isn't easy.</i>

00:12:11.320 --> 00:12:13.210
<i>Roulette and baccarat</i>

00:12:13.210 --> 00:12:16.870
<i>are designed to give the
casino a slight advantage.</i>

00:12:17.420 --> 00:12:20.060
<i>The only exceptions are 
craps and blackjack.</i>

00:12:20.670 --> 00:12:22.270
<i>With those two games alone,</i>

00:12:22.270 --> 00:12:25.380
<i>the casino's advantage is minimal.</i>

00:12:29.000 --> 00:12:31.640
<i>There are basic rules for blackjack.</i>

00:12:32.320 --> 00:12:35.250
<i>Follow them and you can win, a little.</i>

00:12:35.770 --> 00:12:36.650
<i>Of course,</i>

00:12:36.650 --> 00:12:38.940
<i>it only makes as much money as any job</i>

00:12:38.940 --> 00:12:41.900
<i>where you're exchanging 
your time for money.</i>

00:12:42.380 --> 00:12:45.050
<i>Still, if you want 
to attract attention,</i>

00:12:45.050 --> 00:12:46.660
<i>you have to keep winning.</i>

00:13:13.540 --> 00:13:17.530
Miss, you're having a splendid run.

00:13:17.530 --> 00:13:19.840
Can I share in your good luck?

00:13:19.840 --> 00:13:22.250
Of course. Let's have a good time.

00:13:23.730 --> 00:13:26.800
<i>I was planning on inviting someone,</i>

00:13:26.800 --> 00:13:28.480
<i>but he saved me the trouble.</i>

00:13:28.960 --> 00:13:34.340
<i>A casino can't afford to let 
its best customers lose big.</i>

00:13:34.960 --> 00:13:38.470
<i>If I let him bet his chips, 
and start winning more,</i>

00:13:38.470 --> 00:13:41.800
<i>they'll have to start 
paying attention to me.</i>

00:13:42.170 --> 00:13:45.500
Hey, will you bet on my hand?

00:13:45.500 --> 00:13:46.620
Sure.

00:13:46.620 --> 00:13:48.300
Let me make some money, okay?

00:13:57.520 --> 00:14:01.050
<i>Of course, this won't be 
enough to make the casino</i>

00:14:01.050 --> 00:14:03.150
<i>view me as anything more 
than a skilled gambler.</i>

00:14:03.490 --> 00:14:07.240
<i>But in this case, I have to 
stand out a little more.</i>

00:14:07.810 --> 00:14:11.410
<i>Actually, the fastest 
way to win in a casino</i>

00:14:11.410 --> 00:14:13.460
<i>is to take another player's chips.</i>

00:14:13.930 --> 00:14:17.020
<i>Take them from the other 
customers and the dealer,</i>

00:14:17.020 --> 00:14:20.450
<i>and you might be able 
to get a couple million.</i>

00:14:21.170 --> 00:14:25.170
<i>Of course, the casino watches 
for this carefully.</i>

00:14:25.480 --> 00:14:28.640
Arita, there's a woman 
who's making trouble.

00:14:28.640 --> 00:14:30.180
She's wearing a fancy kimono.

00:14:31.050 --> 00:14:33.140
Yes, understood.

00:14:34.520 --> 00:14:38.740
Ma'am, we cannot allow 
that in our casino.

00:14:38.740 --> 00:14:41.730
And what do you mean by "that"?

00:14:42.110 --> 00:14:45.760
You took those chips 
from him, didn't you?

00:14:45.760 --> 00:14:46.920
<i>Here it is.</i>

00:14:46.920 --> 00:14:50.640
<i>Normally, they'd kick me out,</i>

00:14:50.640 --> 00:14:52.990
<i>but now the CEO right here will help me.</i>

00:14:53.280 --> 00:14:56.760
Oh my, that man's making strange accusations!

00:14:57.980 --> 00:15:00.410
Arita-kun, it's fine.

00:15:00.410 --> 00:15:02.650
She's not taking my chips,

00:15:02.650 --> 00:15:05.750
and even if I'm missing a few 
chips, I'm giving them to her.

00:15:06.060 --> 00:15:07.980
Don't worry about it.

00:15:07.980 --> 00:15:11.060
That's right! You're so great!

00:15:12.160 --> 00:15:13.390
I apologize, then.

00:15:14.070 --> 00:15:19.030
But don't try it when 
he's not around, ma'am.

00:15:19.030 --> 00:15:21.020
Oh my, is that a threat?

00:15:21.340 --> 00:15:25.770
I like this casino. I was 
planning on coming more often.

00:15:26.140 --> 00:15:29.240
We'd prefer you didn't.

00:15:29.580 --> 00:15:31.800
Hey, that's rude!

00:15:31.800 --> 00:15:33.700
It's fine.

00:15:33.700 --> 00:15:37.660
I'm here to break this casino anyway.

00:15:39.640 --> 00:15:43.830
And now that I've got my eye 
on it, I'm sure to break it.

00:15:45.560 --> 00:15:46.840
You're kidding.

00:15:46.840 --> 00:15:48.350
You think so?

00:15:48.350 --> 00:15:49.630
Even if you chase me away,

00:15:49.630 --> 00:15:51.700
my friends will come every day,

00:15:51.700 --> 00:15:53.520
and keep winning, little by little.

00:15:53.520 --> 00:15:56.370
They'll come and go and 
you'll never have a clue.

00:15:56.370 --> 00:15:58.350
You saw my skills, didn't you?

00:15:59.010 --> 00:16:02.750
It would've been easy for me 
to do it without you seeing.

00:16:02.750 --> 00:16:05.700
And soon your take will start dropping.

00:16:05.700 --> 00:16:08.320
You won't be able to run 
this place anymore.

00:16:08.880 --> 00:16:11.220
Is that a threat?

00:16:11.220 --> 00:16:13.700
Don't think we'll let 
you get away with it.

00:16:14.200 --> 00:16:17.030
Hey, this is going to be 
a hassle for both of us,

00:16:17.030 --> 00:16:19.400
so let's decide it in a single round.

00:16:19.400 --> 00:16:21.430
A game of poker.

00:16:21.430 --> 00:16:23.340
I'll offer one billion yen.

00:16:23.340 --> 00:16:25.250
And you offer the casino.

00:16:27.380 --> 00:16:29.590
What shall we do, Kanbara-san?

00:16:32.220 --> 00:16:33.300
Understood.

00:16:34.150 --> 00:16:35.220
He says he'll do it.

00:16:35.550 --> 00:16:37.000
Great.

00:16:37.000 --> 00:16:39.580
First, I'd like to see if you 
really have the one billion.

00:16:42.500 --> 00:16:45.810
Here, it's a bank statement.

00:16:47.280 --> 00:16:48.380
Very well.

00:16:48.880 --> 00:16:51.240
We'll prepare one billion in chips.

00:16:51.870 --> 00:16:53.970
And when they're all gone,

00:16:53.970 --> 00:16:56.430
we'll give you the rights to the casino.

00:16:57.580 --> 00:16:59.610
This will be a fun game.

00:16:59.610 --> 00:17:04.250
I'll be the dealer, to make it fair.

00:17:42.880 --> 00:17:45.050
Cheating?

00:17:45.050 --> 00:17:46.810
That's not fair, ma'am.

00:17:47.920 --> 00:17:50.670
Arita-san, it was the 
ambassador's daughter

00:17:50.670 --> 00:17:52.590
who sounded the alarm.

00:17:52.590 --> 00:17:54.820
I knew it.

00:17:55.310 --> 00:17:56.570
Turn it off.

00:17:56.570 --> 00:17:57.450
Yes, sir.

00:17:58.810 --> 00:18:01.850
It looks like you were working together,

00:18:01.850 --> 00:18:04.220
but it failed, ma'am.

00:18:06.850 --> 00:18:09.080
Then I'll be on my way.

00:18:09.480 --> 00:18:12.980
I suppose I'm out fifty million.

00:18:13.230 --> 00:18:16.900
Hold on, the game's just getting started.

00:18:19.270 --> 00:18:21.360
You talked quite a big game.

00:18:21.830 --> 00:18:26.160
You're going to have to continue 
until you hand it all over.

00:19:02.530 --> 00:19:04.120
Miss...

00:19:08.490 --> 00:19:13.090
I never get tired of seeing them 
after they've lost everything!

00:19:18.510 --> 00:19:21.550
The safes! The safes are empty!

00:19:22.130 --> 00:19:24.540
Why didn't the emergency alarm go off?

00:19:24.540 --> 00:19:25.460
I see!

00:19:25.460 --> 00:19:26.270
The girl!

00:19:26.600 --> 00:19:27.890
Arita!

00:19:27.890 --> 00:19:31.060
That woman! Chase that woman!

00:19:35.890 --> 00:19:37.420
What's going on?

00:19:37.420 --> 00:19:40.720
You said you would win 
and break the casino!

00:19:40.720 --> 00:19:42.100
Hold on!

00:19:42.550 --> 00:19:45.620
There was another plan! 
I got the money!

00:19:46.020 --> 00:19:47.360
What?

00:19:47.360 --> 00:19:50.440
Unless you break the 
casino, there's no point!

00:19:50.440 --> 00:19:51.420
I said...

00:19:51.420 --> 00:19:53.170
It's over!

00:20:04.800 --> 00:20:06.550
Damn it.

00:20:10.810 --> 00:20:11.780
Damn!

00:20:11.780 --> 00:20:13.610
This was an act, too!

00:20:15.990 --> 00:20:17.150
So you figured it out, huh?

00:20:19.780 --> 00:20:21.490
Enough!

00:20:21.490 --> 00:20:22.710
You're both coming with me!

00:20:22.710 --> 00:20:24.350
Okay, that's enough.

00:20:31.640 --> 00:20:34.040
You. Possession of an illegal firearm.

00:20:34.350 --> 00:20:37.210
You. You're wanted for fraud.

00:20:37.830 --> 00:20:39.730
Thank you for your cooperation.

00:20:39.730 --> 00:20:41.620
Um, this girl.

00:20:41.620 --> 00:20:43.560
Hey, get in the car.

00:20:50.690 --> 00:20:53.430
But we've got this.

00:20:53.430 --> 00:20:56.010
Even with the money in the bank gone...

00:20:56.560 --> 00:20:58.570
Kiddy Bank

00:20:56.560 --> 00:20:58.570
Matsunaga Hisahide-sama

00:20:58.880 --> 00:21:00.250
No way!

00:21:04.410 --> 00:21:07.370
I guess we got arrested.

00:21:07.780 --> 00:21:10.660
Sorry I didn't tell you.

00:21:10.660 --> 00:21:13.820
But now the embassy will be safe.

00:21:14.600 --> 00:21:15.790
Right, Yama-chan?

00:21:16.410 --> 00:21:19.040
That's right, Hisahide-san.

00:21:19.950 --> 00:21:21.320
Then...

00:21:21.320 --> 00:21:23.050
He was in on it with me.

00:21:23.050 --> 00:21:24.900
So were they.

00:21:26.300 --> 00:21:29.300
Now then, I've gotta go 
into hiding for a while.

00:21:29.890 --> 00:21:33.810
I hope this is enough to ruin them.

00:21:34.360 --> 00:21:36.940
Is my father okay?

00:21:36.940 --> 00:21:39.520
We'll have to make sure the 
ambassador will be safe, too.

00:21:39.810 --> 00:21:41.410
But leave it to me.

00:21:41.410 --> 00:21:43.580
We've got plenty of money.

00:21:43.580 --> 00:21:45.030
It'll work out.

00:21:47.430 --> 00:21:51.080
For now, you're in charge 
of cooking, Sarah-chan.

00:21:51.590 --> 00:21:52.460
Okay!

00:21:55.410 --> 00:21:59.530
<i>A pro always sees two 
or three steps ahead.</i>

00:22:00.130 --> 00:22:03.160
<i>But I couldn't predict this.</i>

00:22:03.730 --> 00:22:09.260
<i>It's possible, now that 
I'm in this new world,</i>

00:22:09.260 --> 00:22:11.880
<i>my bloodthirsty life 
has begun to change.</i>

00:22:12.700 --> 00:22:14.310
<i>Just a little.</i>

00:23:45.940 --> 00:23:49.530
Wow! Next time it's the dancing 
blossom, Maeda Keiji.

00:23:49.530 --> 00:23:53.370
Next time on Sengoku 
Collection: "Dancing Blossom."

00:23:54.230 --> 00:23:57.170
If you believe a preview 
by a villain like me,

00:23:57.170 --> 00:23:59.460
you might regret it later.
